 "Contiguous Angle-Sweep Geographic Clustering", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "app/api/itineraries/[id]/generate/route.ts", "source_location": "L83-L91", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Places are sorted by polar angle around the centroid and chunked into contiguous arc slices (Day 0 = first arc, Day 1 = next arc). Round-robin (i % daysCount) would interleave clusters and defeat the sweep, so each day stays a geographic cluster."}, {"id": "generate_random_sweep_rotation", "label": "Random Rotation of Angle Sweep Start", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "app/api/itineraries/[id]/generate/route.ts", "source_location": "L76-L81", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The angle sort is deterministic, so without rotation a shuffled input produces the exact same arcs every run. Starting the sweep at a random offset (only when shuffle=true) changes where arc boundaries fall while keeping each day a contiguous slice of the circle."}, {"id": "generate_random_trim_in_order", "label": "Order-Preserving Random Trim (sampleInOrder)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "app/api/itineraries/[id]/generate/route.ts", "source_location": "L40-L54", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "When shuffling, keep a random subset of at most k items but re-sort the picked indices ascending to preserve the original angle-sweep order, so the trimmed day still reads as one contiguous arc. Trim is applied per-day after assignment because a global pre-trim would just drop the tail in createdAt order and destroy spatial clusters."}, {"id": "generate_random_nn_start", "label": "Random Nearest-Neighbour Start Point", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "app/api/itineraries/[id]/generate/route.ts", "source_location": "L126-L128", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The greedy nearest-neighbour walk starts at a random point when shuffle=true (index 0 otherwise) so the within-day walking path varies between shuffled runs; the greedy traversal itself remains deterministic given the start."}, {"id": "generate_eligible_preshuffle", "label": "Pre-Shuffle Limitation of Eligible Places", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "app/api/itineraries/[id]/generate/route.ts", "source_location": "L205-L214", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fisher-Yates-style pre-shuffle of eligible places alone cannot vary output because assignDays re-sorts by angle; it only randomizes angle-sort ties (co-located places) and the no-coords round-robin. The real shuffle variation comes from the random sweep rotation, the random in-order trim, and the random nearest-neighbour start."}], "edges": [{"source": "generate_POST", "target": "generate_requireUserId", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/api/itineraries/[id]/generate/route.ts", "source_location": "L151", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "generate_POST", "target": "generate_assignDays", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/api/itineraries/[id]/generate/route.ts", "source_location": "L220", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "generate_POST", "target": "generate_sampleInOrder", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/api/itineraries/[id]/generate/route.ts", "source_location": "L222", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "generate_POST", "target": "generate_orderWithinDay", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/api/itineraries/[id]/generate/route.ts", "source_location": "L222", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "generate_POST", "target": "generate_itemsCacheKey", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/api/itineraries/[id]/generate/route.ts", "source_location": "L268", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "generate_orderWithinDay", "target": "generate_dist2", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/api/itineraries/[id]/generate/route.ts", "source_location": "L137", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "generate_angle_sweep_clustering", "target": "generate_assignDays", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/api/itineraries/[id]/generate/route.ts", "source_location": "L83-L91", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "generate_random_sweep_rotation", "target": "generate_assignDays", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/api/itineraries/[id]/generate/route.ts", "source_location": "L76-L81", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "generate_random_trim_in_order", "target": "generate_sampleInOrder", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/api/itineraries/[id]/generate/route.ts", "source_location": "L40-L41", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "generate_random_nn_start", "target": "generate_orderWithinDay", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/api/itineraries/[id]/generate/route.ts", "source_location": "L126-L127", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "generate_eligible_preshuffle", "target": "generate_POST", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "app/api/itineraries/[id]/generate/route.ts", "source_location": "L205-L214", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "generate_random_sweep_rotation", "target": "generate_random_nn_start", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "app/api/itineraries/[id]/generate/route.ts", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "shuffle_randomness_flow", "label": "S